stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : create (POST /purchases)
    PENDING --> PENDING : update items / supplier
    PENDING --> APPROVED : approve (OWNER)
    APPROVED --> PARTIAL : receive (some items missing)
    APPROVED --> COMPLETED : receive (all items received)
    PARTIAL --> PARTIAL : receive (still missing)
    PARTIAL --> COMPLETED : receive (all items received)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    note right of PENDING
        Receive is rejected with 409
        unless status is APPROVED or PARTIAL
    end note
